{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":484196,"name":"Ricard","username":"Ricard1","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/r/258eb7/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-05T19:03:59.304Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484196-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484196-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484196-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484196-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot remains stuck reconnecting on macOS, and my Bots do not load. The same account also fails to connect on mobile. The problem existed before the reset attempt.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTroubleshooting already performed:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRestarted the desktop app.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAttempted to update Grok Bot’s Computer.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInitiated ONE Reset on September 5, 2026 at 18:18:24 UTC.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAbout 10 minutes later, the client returned: edge/handler-failed: [aborted] socket hang up.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAt 18:33:05 UTC, GetSandBoxRunState returned HTTP 200 with SAND_BOX_RUN_STATE_HIBERNATED and imageUpdateAvailable=true.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEarlier wake-up tests did not complete through either the TUN route or a direct route bypassing TUN.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo additional Reset has been initiated. I understand that hibernation is normal and the client timeout does not establish the backend reset outcome.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEmail support ticket: T-F50709. The AI support assistant said it could not inspect the backend reset state, arrange a human handoff, or perform manual recovery, and indicated it was closing the ticket.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCould a staff member investigate the cloud computer associated with my account and determine whether recovery is needed?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484196-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484196-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOn my affected account:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Grok Bot on macOS while signed in.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWait for the cloud computer to connect.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe app remains stuck reconnecting, and Bots do not load.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Grok Bot on mobile using the same account.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe mobile app also fails to connect.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484196-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484196-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe cloud computer should wake up and connect successfully. My Bots should load, and I should be able to send messages from both desktop and mobile.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484196-operating-system-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484196-operating-system-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMacOS\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484196-version-information-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484196-version-information-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot desktop: 0.43.0 (stable)\u003cbr\u003e\nOperating system: macOS 26.2\u003cbr\u003e\nThe same account also fails to connect on mobile; mobile version not yet recorded.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484196-for-ai-issues-which-model-did-you-use-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484196-for-ai-issues-which-model-did-you-use-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eFor AI issues: which model did you use?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eN/A. The app cannot connect to the cloud computer or load Bots, so I cannot start a conversation or identify the active model.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484196-for-ai-issues-add-request-id-with-privacy-disabled-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484196-for-ai-issues-add-request-id-with-privacy-disabled-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eFor AI issues: add Request ID with privacy disabled\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo model/inference Request ID is available. The sidebar is also unusable, so I cannot copy a Conversation ID.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCloud-control client request IDs are provided under Additional Information.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484196-additional-information-9\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484196-additional-information-9\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eAdditional Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSupport ticket: T-F50709.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCloud-control client request IDs (these are not model Request IDs or Conversation IDs):\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eForceRecreateSandBox:\u003cbr\u003e\n28b7fd39-78c1-4758-8ab1-ef6434be57f2\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEnsureSandBox:\u003cbr\u003e\n8be1169c-a42c-4401-9490-f3cb37c5c5af\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWatchSandBoxMigration:\u003cbr\u003e\n03099f9e-b888-437c-8dcf-09f10b6d57f8\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe single Reset was initiated on September 5, 2026 at 18:18:24 UTC. The client disconnected approximately 10 minutes later; the backend outcome remains unknown.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEmail support said these IDs were not found in standard request logs. Please correlate my account and the timestamp with the cloud computer’s lifecycle/recovery logs.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot is completely unusable on both desktop and mobile. Please arrange a manual investigation. I can provide account details privately to staff.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484196-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-10\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484196-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-10\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/3/b/3b82fbef38136bf3e7954a7666f69ff9dfea2c5e.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/8usNMunTKwlcS2JxqDZO2CVQMNg.png?dl=1\" title=\"image\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/3/b/3b82fbef38136bf3e7954a7666f69ff9dfea2c5e_2_684x500.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"8usNMunTKwlcS2JxqDZO2CVQMNg\" width=\"684\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/3/b/3b82fbef38136bf3e7954a7666f69ff9dfea2c5e_2_684x500.png, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/3/b/3b82fbef38136bf3e7954a7666f69ff9dfea2c5e_2_1026x750.png 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/3/b/3b82fbef38136bf3e7954a7666f69ff9dfea2c5e_2_1368x1000.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"0B0B0B\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eimage\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e2080×1520 56.8 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2026-09-07T08:53:06.408Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":26,"